{
  "_readme": [
    "PLACEHOLDER — awaiting the client's own file. Everything the registration",
    "form offers and everything the visit planner matches against lives HERE,",
    "not in code. Replacing this file replaces the taxonomy; no Python, JS or",
    "CSS changes are needed, and no restart (the loader watches the mtime).",
    "",
    "Contract (app/services/taxonomy.py validates it and refuses a broken file",
    "rather than shipping a half-loaded one):",
    "  jobs[]      {id, fa, en}                    -> the شغل dropdown",
    "  positions[] {id, fa, en}               -> the سمت dropdown (optional;",
    "                                            omit it and سمت becomes free text)",
    "  interests[] {id, fa, en, keywords?}         -> the searchable multi-select",
    "  flags[]     {id, fa, en}                    -> the checkboxes",
    "  sections[]  {id, fa, en, keywords, why_fa, why_en} -> what gets recommended",
    "  fallback_ids[]                              -> shown when nothing matches",
    "",
    "`keywords` on an interest is optional: it widens matching for a label whose",
    "wording differs from the section's (IOT -> اینترنت اشیا). Visitors may add",
    "their own interests; those are free text and match on their own words."
  ],
